<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Davids half year net profit eases.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Davids half year net profit eases.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   44.90  vs 45.23</p>
<p>    Net				    24.15  vs 29.24</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		    5.0   vs  5.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Davids Holdings Ltd is a grocery wholesaler.  </p>
<p>    Sales (billion)			2.53 vs  1.91</p>
<p>    Other income			 142.83 vs 62.14</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    5.42 vs   8.88</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  loss 4.74 vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 pct franked</p>
<p>Pay date April 30</p>
<p>Reg date April 18</p>
<p>    Tax				     15.90 vs  15.64</p>
<p>    Interest				13.71 vs  12.43</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  22.59 vs  11.27</p>
<p>    Minorities			     0.10 vs   0.35</p>
<p>    Shrs (million)		     445.78 vs 308.55</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
